LACCD Chatbot Mobile
=====================

This Android application is a derivative work of Google AI Edge Gallery
(https://github.com/google-ai-edge/gallery), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. See LICENSE for the full Apache 2.0 license text.

Modifications from the upstream codebase made in this fork:
  - Repackaged from `com.google.ai.edge.gallery` to `com.laccd.chatbot`.
  - Removed Firebase Analytics, Firebase Cloud Messaging, FirebaseApp init, and
    the Google Services Gradle plugin. The `firebaseAnalytics` property was
    rewritten to a local no-op stub so existing call sites keep compiling
    without telemetry leaving the device.
  - Removed the Gemma 4 marketing surfaces (PromoBannerGm4, PromoScreenGm4,
    NewReleaseNotification).
  - Removed unmaintained optional demo surfaces and provider-authentication
    scaffolding.
  - Retained local model import and explicit sideloading; disabled Android
    backup and required external release signing.
  - Adjusted toolchain to AGP 9.2.1 / Kotlin 2.3.21 / JDK 17 / minSdk 31.

Original Edge Gallery copyright lines are preserved in each file.

